       <td> <p class="pChart_bodyCMT" style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; margin-bottom: 3pt; margin-left: 3pt; margin-right: 3pt; margin-top: 3pt; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0pt; text-transform: none"><b>Operational cost reduction and simplification</b></p> </td> 
       <td> <p class="pChart_bodyCMT" style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; margin-bottom: 3pt; margin-left: 3pt; margin-right: 3pt; margin-top: 3pt; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0pt; text-transform: none">Consolidate policy and operations, reduce manual correlation, automate repeatable work, and lower the effort required to run and change the environment.</p> </td> 
