       <td> <p class="pChart_bodyCMT" style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; margin-bottom: 3pt; margin-left: 3pt; margin-right: 3pt; margin-top: 3pt; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0pt; text-transform: none">Prioritize exposure, contain lateral movement, maintain evidence, and turn policy intent into provable enforcement.</p> </td> 
